      Ok folks, we are going to do this for you again.  There are 10 parts
to the C-KERMIT release 2 posting.  There has been alot of work done on this
new improved version.  I have yet to check it all out, but beleive me, there
are lots of new things.  This version includes code for dialing and auto-logon
scripts using the L.sys style of script.  Please read the docs carefully as I
have no earthly idea at this point, what has really changed.  Please do not
send this to another news group unless you are sure they want it.  The cost
to those involved in mailing this thing is large, so do be discriminate.  

      The 10 files include are shell archives.  Two of the doc files are in
2 parts.  As you see the files unpack, you will see something like:

x - ckermi.doc  part 1
x - ckermi.doc  part 2

It is imperitive that you unpack the modules by the numerical order of the
postings.  Otherwize you will get only the first part of the documents.  The
first 4 files here are the ones to be concerned with.


